# 1. Sign up at https://openrouter.ai (free, no credit card)
# 2. Create an API key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# 3. In Settings > Privacy, enable model training consent (required for free :free models)
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000